'' A statement the lowering declines STOPS THE BUILD: TKO0994 at its line, exit 4, no
'' executable. It was a count printed only under --dump-ir, and the program was built
'' without the statement. The declining statement is made one (TIKO_TEST_DECLINE_LINE): none
'' declines by itself any more.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target windows-x86_64 tests/driver/src/unlowered-stops-build.bas -o tests/driver/unloweredstops.exe
'' ENV: TIKO_LIBPATH=build/obj/rtlib/windows-x86_64
'' ENV: TIKO_TEST_DECLINE_LINE=5
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 4
'' EXPECT-OUT: unlowered-stops-build.bas(5,1): error TKO0994
'' EXPECT-OUT: this N_INTRINSIC was not compiled
'' EXPECT-NO-FILE: tests/driver/unloweredstops.exe
